        <item>
            <title>3.9.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 15:36:55 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>146</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.9.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.9.2</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Added</strong></p><ul><li>Create folders directly while choosing files or a watched folder</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Get started faster with a shorter first-run setup</li><li>File pickers now stay in front of Zush windows</li><li>Clearer provider selection when switching AI modes</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>More reliable rename handling when a file already has its Zush name</li></ul>
]]></description>
